inputs.aiPrompt:
Generate a professional and friendly payment reminder email for the following invoice:

Client Name: @{body('Calculate_Reminder_Logic')?['client_name']}
Invoice Number: @{body('Calculate_Reminder_Logic')?['invoice_number']}
Amount: @{body('Calculate_Reminder_Logic')?['currency']} @{body('Calculate_Reminder_Logic')?['invoice_amount']}
Issue Date: @{body('Calculate_Reminder_Logic')?['issue_date']}
Due Date: @{body('Calculate_Reminder_Logic')?['due_date']}
Days Overdue: @{body('Calculate_Reminder_Logic')?['daysOverdue']}
Reminder Type: @{body('Calculate_Reminder_Logic')?['reminderType']}
Urgency: @{body('Calculate_Reminder_Logic')?['urgencyLevel']}

The email should:
- Be courteous and professional
- Clearly state the outstanding amount and invoice details
- Mention the due date and overdue status if applicable
- Include a polite call-to-action for payment
- Provide payment instructions or link
- Be appropriately urgent based on the reminder type
- End with a professional signature

Format the response as a complete email with subject line.

